1
00:00:00,846 --> 00:00:02,916
(Leonard:)Nothing.

2
00:00:02,915 --> 00:00:05,645
(Penny:)Oh, come on, Leonard, I know
the car was a thoughtful gesture

3
00:00:05,651 --> 00:00:06,951
(Penny:)and I really appreciate it,

4
00:00:06,952 --> 00:00:08,782
(Penny:)but it doesn't make sense
to have both.

5
00:00:08,788 --> 00:00:10,688
(Leonard:)You're right.
What should
I have done?

6
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:14,220
(Penny:)Taken a picture of us in the car
and put it in a pink frame

7
00:00:14,226 --> 00:00:18,326
(Penny:)with puffy paint around it
that says "best fiancé ever"?

8
00:00:19,865 --> 00:00:22,195
(Leonard:)Doesn't sound that bad.

9
00:00:22,201 --> 00:00:24,431
(Penny:)Well, good, because...
that's why I did!

10
00:00:24,437 --> 00:00:25,567
(Leonard:)Aw...

11
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:28,569
(Penny:)Oh...

12
00:00:28,574 --> 00:00:29,644
(Leonard:)thank you.

13
00:00:29,642 --> 00:00:31,242
That-that is so sweet.
No, it's not

14
00:00:31,243 --> 00:00:32,973
(Penny:)that sweet--
I paid for the frame

15
00:00:32,978 --> 00:00:35,248
(Penny:)with your money
and then got a massage.

16
00:00:35,247 --> 00:00:38,617
(Leonard:)You know what, you don't
have to give me this.

17
00:00:38,617 --> 00:00:39,987
(Leonard:)You keep it.

18
00:00:39,985 --> 00:00:41,215
(Penny:)Why?
The car

19
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,820
(Leonard:)was a gift-- it was something
you needed.

20
00:00:42,822 --> 00:00:44,292
(Leonard:)I was happy to
help you out.

21
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:47,090
(Penny:)And I really appreciate it,
but now I don't need it,

22
00:00:47,093 --> 00:00:49,323
(Penny:)so... here you go.
Well,

23
00:00:49,328 --> 00:00:51,098
(Leonard:)this is silly-- so you
don't need the car,

24
00:00:51,097 --> 00:00:52,997
(Leonard:)but you could use it to buy
yourself something else,

25
00:00:52,998 --> 00:00:57,138
(Leonard:)like a... new purse to
put all this money in.

26
00:00:57,136 --> 00:00:58,636
(Penny:)Sweetie, I can buy my own stuff.

27
00:00:58,637 --> 00:01:00,067
(Penny:)I have a good job now.

